<title>FRANCE: Banque Paribas H1 net attrib 1.27 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Banque Paribas H1 net attrib 1.27 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			  1,274 vs		 124</p>
<p>    Net profit				  2,011 vs		 357</p>
<p>    Pre-tax operating			 2,986 vs	     1,404</p>
<p>    Pre-tax operating income		8,030 vs	     5,974</p>
<p>    Net banking income			6,866 vs	     5,821</p>
<p>    Net new provisions			  350 vs		 341</p>
<p>NOTE - Banque Paribas, a unit of Groupe Paribas, gave its first-half results in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 ylg/pnt/bfl</p>
